>I've got similar problems too.  My Nethack simply locks up after I
>finish a game, forcing me to reset.
>What is going on?

99% of the time that we hear "Amiga NetHack locks up on exit" the cause is
a shortage of chip ram.  Try reducing the number of things that are
running at the same time and eating up chip memory (this may include
disk buffers for some types of disks).
